ャラクターの設定ですが、「チャラ系」で、表情は「ぱっと見は笑みを浮かべているように見えるが、よく見ると実際には笑っていない」という雰囲気です。\n\nもし地下アイドルのような設定で描いていただける場合は、チェキ風で“ファンサで釣っている”ようなイメージだと嬉しいです。\n\n何か失礼がありましたら申し訳ありません。\nよろしくお願い致します。＞＜\n\n使用について\n*自分鑑賞用\n*はがき/缶バッジにして友人に贈る\n\nhttps://www.tumblr.com/nokonkk7/720746299028389888", "nc": 128, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}], "sent_works": [], "similar_creators": [{"id": 1679358, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": false, "acceptable": true, "name": "もなか食", "screen_name": "nirako_mona", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1648155212643803137/EwyodAo5.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1360173123245539330/1681785799/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 30, "complete_expiration_days": 60, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}], "banned": false, "nc": 145}, {"id": 2017469, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": false, "acceptable": true, "name": "potato/skeb専用", "screen_name": "popopopopo623sk", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1521147184636317697/_JLhHJyE.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1521141599979249665/1658074820/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": 51, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 3, "complete_expiration_days": 10, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}], "banned": false, "nc": 145}, {"id": 2543495, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": false, "acceptable": true, "name": "此田", "screen_name": "kono_d3", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1942849304495812608/TzK6YTO3.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1510990546684485645/1684600575/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_